Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libqt6core6t64 (>= 6.5), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.5), libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.5), libqt6network6 (>= 6.5), libqt6svg6 (>= 6.5), libqt6websockets6 (>= 6.5), libqt6multimedia6 (>= 6.5), libqt6sql6 (>= 6.5), libqt6sql6-sqlite, libcairo2, libpango-1.0-0, libpangocairo-1.0-0, libobs0t64 (>= 30), libavcodec62, libavformat62, libavutil60, libswscale9, libswresample6, liblz4-1, ffmpeg
Description: Flux Motion title graphics editor and renderer
 Creates, previews, and renders animated title graphics using the Flux Motion
 rendering engine and the OBS OpenGL graphics backend.
